    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": {
        "en": "Double-Digit Inversion Rule"
      },
      "body": "In German, numbers from 21 to 99 are spoken **units first, then tens**, linked by **und** ('and'):\n\n- 21 = **einsundzwanzig** (one-and-twenty)\n- 22 = **zweiundzwanzig** (two-and-twenty)\n- 35 = **fünfunddreißig** (five-and-thirty)"
    },
